1
00:00:00,701 --> 00:00:01,701
(Bernadette:)Thank you, Raj.

2
00:00:01,868 --> 00:00:04,438
(Raj:)Please, this is my way
of thanking you

3
00:00:04,604 --> 00:00:06,274
(Raj:)for letting me stay here.

4
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:09,220
(Raj:)Now, tell us all about your day.

5
00:00:09,376 --> 00:00:11,216
Okay, well, first,

6
00:00:11,378 --> 00:00:13,218
(Bernadette:)I was late to a meeting
because I was stuck in traffic.

7
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:15,290
(Howard:)I keep telling you to put
that traffic app on your phone.

8
00:00:15,349 --> 00:00:18,129
(Raj:)Hey, when you got home today
complaining that you felt sick

9
00:00:18,285 --> 00:00:20,565
(Raj:)from eating too many jelly beans,
did I tell you how to fix it?

10
00:00:20,721 --> 00:00:21,721
(Sheldon:)No.

11
00:00:23,657 --> 00:00:26,637
I said, "Aw, that must hurt,"
and I rubbed your belly.

12
00:00:30,998 --> 00:00:32,708
(Howard:)I thought of you the whole time.

13
00:00:35,836 --> 00:00:38,146
(Raj:)All I'm saying is
there's a time to just listen.

14
00:00:38,305 --> 00:00:39,475
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

15
00:00:39,639 --> 00:00:41,639
(Raj:)There's also a time to stop
eating too many jelly beans.

16
00:00:41,808 --> 00:00:43,378
(Raj:)And it's when you're ten.

17
00:00:46,747 --> 00:00:48,227
(Sheldon:)Hello, President Siebert.

18
00:00:48,382 --> 00:00:49,762
(Sheldon:)Thank you for taking my call.

19
00:00:49,916 --> 00:00:52,556
(Sheldon:)I just wanted you to know
that you can now expect

20
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:56,399
(Sheldon:)enthusiastic participation
from me regarding my discovery.

21
00:00:56,556 --> 00:00:57,656
(Sheldon:)No, no, no, no.

22
00:00:57,824 --> 00:00:59,024
No need to thank me.

